<title>USA: TABLE- Fortress Group Q2 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Fortress Group Q2 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.14			N/A</p>
<p> Shr			   0.10		    $0.19</p>
<p> Net			    1.3			1.9</p>
<p> Revs			 105.6		     67.2</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     N/A			N/A</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.22			N/A</p>
<p> Shr			   0.18		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			    2.3			2.3</p>
<p> Revs			 175.6		    108.5</p>
<p> Avg			    N/A			N/A</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fortress Group's net earnings include non-recurring charges of $1.7 million for the 1997 quarter and $2.4 million for the 1977 first half.</p>
<p>Per share amounts for the first half of 1997 recognize a 34 percent increase in the weighted avarage shares outstanding over the first half of 1996. For the 1997 second quarter, per share amounts reflect a 28 percent increase in weighted shares outstanding from the 1996 quarter</p>
